// "Reinforces your magic" utility buff, no damage in the sheet -- `Hastened`
// (a generic empowerment stand-in, already reused this pass for non-movement
// "quickened power" flavor) as the closest existing primitive; the sheet's
// own light-emission rider is purely visual/non-mechanical.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.25,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Hastened, data: BuffData(strength: 0.2, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 110.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Evocation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 8 spell -> min_level 48, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(48)),
    ),
)
